Traffic within most parts of the Metropolis is in sweet shape at the moment. 

- Traffic in and out of Berger is good.
- Traffic in and out of Agege Motor Road is good.
- Traffic in and out of Abule Egba is good.
- Traffic in and out of the Lekki Ikoyi link Bridge is good, despite a high influx of vehicles.
- Traffic in and out of Opebi, Allen, Awolowo Way is good.
- Traffic in and out of VI is good as well.

